	(text "J18: board-to-board link to the sensing PCB, Hirose FH12S-30S-0.5SH(55), 30 pos 0.5 mm FFC.\nCable: same-side contacts (type A) FFC, both connectors on the top side facing each other:\nconductor on pin k of the power PCB connector lands on pin 31-k of the sensing PCB connector.\nThe two schematics already account for this (sensing pin 31-k = power pin k).\nSupply pins are mirror-symmetric, so a reversed (type B) cable swaps only signals, never supplies.\n+5V: 4 pins (2 A at 0.5 A/pin), +3V3D: 2 pins, GND: 12 pins + MP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100.02 106.3 0)
		(effects
